@startuml
title Proposed approval and quality enforcement
start
:Validate repository, branches and exact source identity;
if (Approved design and activated AEO-4 policy?) then (yes)
if (Fresh quality and required security evidence?) then (yes)
if (Exact authorized publishing action?) then (yes)
:Persist authorized operation intent before mutation;
:Reconcile PR and current head;
if (Required exact-head CI, human review and dependencies verified?) then (yes)
:Report ready for authorized merge;
else (no)
:Report every unmet remote requirement;
endif
else (no)
:Block publication - human grant required;
endif
else (no)
:Block publication - quality or security evidence;
endif
else (no)
:Block publication - design or policy missing;
endif
stop
@enduml
